  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/1d/c9/41/1dc94136fe02dcfb8bcc07dc04f16a28.png\" alt=\"侏罗纪世界重生II横幅\" width=\"1124\" height=\"591\"></p>\n<p>&lrm; &lrm; <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JMqZhxk7gA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/831803522281635850?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=4a94fb&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"172\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"https://patreon.com/KnightDexx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=KnightDexx&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"166\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fKNIGHTDEXX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Rent -a server-9cf?style=for-the-badge&logo=Codeforces&logoColor=cyan\" alt=\"租赁服务器\" width=\"139\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dexxknight1/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-modpacks-red?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"项目\" width=\"132\" height=\"24\"></a> &lrm; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fdexxknight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Support me on Ko-fi&color=C0C0C0&labelColor=4a94fb&style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持\" width=\"179\" height=\"24\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fall%252fmodpacks%252fjurassic-world-reborn-ii%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c1ji64K.png\" alt=\"MMC评测\" width=\"390\" height=\"65\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦕 欢迎来到侏罗纪世界重生II 🦕</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">踏入一个过去重现生机、远古巨兽再次漫步大地的世界。<strong>侏罗纪世界重生II</strong> 邀你踏上一段穿越时空的非凡探险之旅，在这里科学与史前奇迹交汇，世界的每一个角落都蕴藏着等待被发掘的新发现。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">这不仅仅是生存——而是一场<strong>史诗级的古生物冒险</strong>。从远古化石中提取DNA，培育数百万年未曾踏足大地的生物，并建立属于你自己的侏罗纪庇护所。从海洋深处无声滑行的海生爬行动物，到天空中翱翔的无齿翼龙，每一个生物群系都成为窥探地球遥远过去的窗口。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">但史前世界仅仅是个开始。穿梭于神秘的维度，驾驭强大的科技，精通奥术魔法，并与同伴探险家结成联盟。你将成为一名著名的古生物学家、敢于探索未知领域的无畏冒险者，还是创造终极恐龙园的远见卓识的建筑师？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:15px\">凭借升级的视觉效果、身临其境的背景音效以及精心打造的生态系统，在这个模组天堂中的每一刻都仿佛是一场真正的探险。远处的火山隆隆作响，瀑布穿过茂密丛林倾泻而下，远古生物的呼唤在荒野中回荡。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>恐龙时代已然回归。你准备好回应召唤了吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#06c\"><strong>💻 系统需求</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>推荐内存：</strong>分配给 Minecraft 的 16GB 至 20GB</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Java：</strong>需要 Java 17+（使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/TheUsefulLists/UsefulMods/blob/main/JavaArgumentsOptimization.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">优化的 Java 参数</a> 以获得最佳性能）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine：</strong>❌ 与此整合包不兼容（着色器已通过 Oculus/Rubidium 内置）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft 版本：</strong>1.20.1 Forge</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/b4/98/40/b4984061a92d4685ff76ac6302586825.png\" alt=\"功能横幅\" width=\"870\" height=\"126\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:#c00\"><strong>🎯 是什么让侏罗纪世界重生II与众不同？</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🦖 史前生命与恐龙</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>560+ 模组</strong> 精心挑选，打造极致侏罗纪体验</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jurassic-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jurassic Reborn (JR)</a> - 包含<strong>108 种不同生物</strong>，涵盖恐龙、海生爬行动物、史前鱼类及基因杂交种</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fossils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fossils &amp; Archeology</a> - 超过<strong>60+ 种史前生物</strong>可通过考古探索复活</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">提取DNA，孵化蛋类，养育你自己的史前伙伴</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">创建自定义栖息地并观察逼真的恐龙行为</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🌍 待探索维度</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a> - 充满神秘与古代遗迹的魔法林地王国</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> - 基岩之下广阔的地下维度，拥有独特的生态系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a> - 包含永恒光明与永恒黎明两个天界领域，点缀着浮空岛屿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多充满史前秘密与宝藏的维度等你发现！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🔍 探索与冒险</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">发现散落于世界各地的隐藏 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2\" rel=\"nofollow\">宝藏</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">探索神秘的地下城与废弃建筑</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">挖掘沉船遗址与水下考古地点</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr</a> - 多人服务器中为每位玩家提供个性化战利品系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reskillable-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Reskillable</a> - 最多可解锁<strong>8 项自定义技能</strong>用于角色成长</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>✨ 魔法与神秘学</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> - 自然魔法与法力操控</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ars-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ars Nouveau</a> - 可自定义的法术制作系统</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/psi\" rel=\"nofollow\">PSI</a> - 通过可视化编程实现可编程法术创作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">驾驭魔法能量，增强你的史前探险体验</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚔️ 武器、护甲与工具</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> - 种类繁多的近战与远程武器库</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-zero\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timeless and Classics Zero Guns</a> - 用于自卫的现代枪械</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Construct</a> - 自定义工具锻造与材料组合</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">抵御凶猛的史前掠食者与敌对探险家</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>🏛️ 装饰与建造</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/decocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Decocraft</a> - 为你的基地提供数千种装饰物件</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/engineers-decor-ported\" rel=\"nofollow\">Engineer's Decor Ported</a> - 工业风格装饰</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel Reborn</a> - 数百种方块变体</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisels &amp; Bits</a> - 微方块建造，打造精致设计</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> - 增强的建筑选项</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bibliocraft-legacy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bibliocraft Legacy</a> - 家具与收纳解决方案</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">建造终极恐龙园、研究设施或史前博物馆！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>💎 独特神器与遗物</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts</a> - 附带特殊能力的强力可穿戴物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics</a> - 带有神秘属性的古代珍宝</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">发掘赋予超凡力量的传奇物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">组合神器，打造终极探险家配置</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>📦 收纳解决方案</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Applied Energistics 2</a> - 高级数字存储网络</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage</a> - 简单易用的物品管理</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/storage-drawers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storage Drawers</a> - 紧凑的大宗存储</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a> - 可升级的储物容器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> - 可升级的便携背包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高效整理你的化石、DNA样本与史前发现物</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚙️ 科技与自动化</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> - 机械装置与动能利用</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thermal-foundation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Series</a> - 发电与矿石加工</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-io\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender IO</a> - 导管与机器自动化</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a> - 高级机械与数字化采矿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Engineering</a> - 多方块机器与线路布线</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-foregoing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Foregoing</a> - 资源加工与农业</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/draconic-evolution\" rel=\"nofollow\">Draconic Evolution</a> - 终局科技与能源</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/void-miners\" rel=\"nofollow\">Void Miners</a> - 自动化资源开采</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">实现恐龙繁育计划与资源收集的自动化！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#228b22\"><strong>⚡ 能源生成</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"